      },
      "descripcion": "__Height:__ 170 cm (5'7\")\n__Classification:__ Parasite\n__Affiliation:__ APE's Special Forces Unit\n__Partner:__ [Hiro](https://anilist.co/character/124380/Hiro)\n__FRANXX:__ Strelizia \n\nZero Two is an elite FRANXX pilot who is a member of a race of humans with Klaxosaur blood, and the pistil of the FranXX Strelizia.",
